WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.113 --> 00:00:03.550
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.940
- Welcome to Ear Biscuits, I'm Link.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.650
